# D/V/O 母胞弛豫：体积+形状+原子（文献：母胞先优化到理论密度）。PBE-D3(BJ)，无 SOC 预筛。
# POTIM=0.1（默认 0.5）：O_ordered 用默认步长时第 10 步起能量上升数百 eV（hanhai 301880，2026-10-23）。
SYSTEM  = {name} parent relax
GGA     = PE
IVDW    = 12
PREC    = Accurate
ENCUT   = 360
LASPH   = .TRUE.
LREAL   = .FALSE.
ALGO    = Normal
EDIFF   = 1E-6
NELM    = 200
ISMEAR  = 0
SIGMA   = 0.05
ISPIN   = 1
ISYM    = 0
IBRION  = 2
POTIM   = 0.1
ISIF    = 3
NSW     = 300
EDIFFG  = -0.02
LWAVE   = .FALSE.
LCHARG  = .FALSE.
NCORE   = 4
KPAR    = 2
